msgstr "Datamaskina vil starte med følgande parameter:"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:18
msgid ""
"In addition to the system configuration you can set your own parameters in "
"the list below"
msgstr ""
"I tillegg til systemoppsettet kan du setje eigne parameter i lista nedanfor"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:19
msgid "Press Save and reboot the computer for changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Trykk Lagre og start datamaskina på nytt for at endringane skal tre i kraft."

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:20
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Lagre"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:21
msgid "Boot Menu"
msgstr "Oppstartsmeny"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:23
msgid "Kernel series"
msgstr "Kjerneserie"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:24
msgid ""
"No kernel series are tracked. This computer may not receive kernel security "
"updates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ingen kjerneseriar blir overvaka. Denne datamaskina vil kanskje ikkje få "
"tryggingsoppdateringar for kjernen.\n"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:26
msgid "View all kernels"
msgstr "Vis alle kjernar"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:27
msgid "Automatic cleanup"
msgstr "Automatisk opprydding"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:28
msgid "Cleanup runs weekly."
msgstr "Opprydding vert køyrd kvar veke."

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:29
msgid "Remove older kernels automatically"
msgstr "Fjern eldre kjernar automatisk"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:30
msgid "Number of installed kernels to keep in each tracked series"
msgstr "Antal installerte kjernar som skal haldast att i kvar overvaka serie"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:31
msgid "The active kernel and tracked metapackages are always protected."
msgstr "Den aktive kjernen og overvaka metapakkar er alltid beskytta."

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:32
msgid "History"
msgstr "Historikk"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:33
msgid "Clean up now"
msgstr "Rydd opp no"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:34
msgid "Kernels"
msgstr "Kjernar"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:35
msgid "Environment variables"
msgstr "Miljøvariablar"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:36
msgid "Set system-wide environment variables using the NAME=VALUE format."
msgstr "Angje miljøvariablar for heile systemet i formatet NAMN=VERDI."

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:37
msgid "Log out and log back in for changes to take effect."
msgstr "Logg ut og inn att for at endringane skal tre i kraft."

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:38
msgid "Environment Variables"
msgstr "Miljøvariablar"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:39
msgid "Allowed sleep modes"
msgstr "Tillatne kvilemodusar"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:40
msgid "Choose the sleep modes you want to allow."
msgstr "Vel kva kvilemodus du vil tillate."

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:42
msgid ""
"Keeps the session in memory (RAM). The computer is still running but uses "
"only a bit of power."
msgstr ""
"Held økta i minnet (RAM). Datamaskina er framleis i gang men brukar lite "
"straum."

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:44
msgid "Saves the session to disk (Swap). Shuts down the computer."
msgstr "Lagrar økta på disken (vekselminne). Slår av datamaskina."

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:46
msgid ""
"Suspends for a while (systemd decides how long, based on battery power), "
"then hibernates."
msgstr ""
"Går i ventemodus ei stund (systemd avgjer kor lenge, basert på "
"batterinivået), deretter i dvalemodus."

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:48
msgid "Suspends but also saves the session to disk (Swap)."
msgstr "Går i ventemodus, men lagrar også økta på disken (veksleområdet)."

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:49
msgid "Suspend method"
msgstr "Metode for ventemodus"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:50
msgid ""
"This is the method used to suspend the computer. Only the methods offered by "
"your BIOS/firmware can be chosen."
msgstr ""
"Dette er metoden som blir brukt for å setje datamaskina i ventemodus. Berre "
"metodane som BIOS/fastvara di tilbyr kan veljast."

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:51
msgid "Hibernation method"
msgstr "Metode for dvalemodus"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:52
msgid "This is method used to power off the computer during hibernation."
msgstr ""
"Dette er metoden som vert brukt til å slå av datamaskina under dvalemodus."

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:53
msgid "Current state"
msgstr "Noværande tilstand"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:54
msgid "Fix any detected issues to make allowed sleep modes available."
msgstr ""
"Rett eventuelle oppdaga problem for å gjere dei tillatne kvilemodusane "
"tilgjengelege."

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:55
msgid "Available sleep modes"
msgstr "Tilgjengelege kvilemodusar"

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:56
msgid "These sleep modes should work right now."
msgstr "Desse kvilemodusane skal fungere no."

#: usr/share/mintsysadm/mintsysadm.ui.h:57
msgid "Sleep Modes"
msgstr "Kvilemodusar"

